# LongShot agent rules

- Read `docs/AIRULES.md`, `docs/SPRINTS.md`, `docs/ROADMAP.md`, and `docs/STATUS.md` before large changes.
- Do not commit secrets (`.env`, credentials, DB dumps).
- Keep alert ingest authenticated (`X-API-Key` or JWT).
- Prefer Docker Compose for local stack; do not reintroduce VirtualBox as the primary path.
- Notifications are in-app (free); do not default to paid SMS/email/FCM.
- UI direction: mobile-first, dynamic, purposeful animations — no AI-slop visuals.
- Stay within the current sprint scope; update docs when behavior or roadmap changes.
- Prefer small diffs; avoid unrelated refactors.
